From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rnsbox <rnsbox@localhost>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 23:20:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 11/16] clients: latest-tracking read-only client disc (dvd) +
 lite/dvd packaging
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

fetch-clients.sh resolves each Reticulum client's latest stable GitHub
release at build time (nothing pinned), verifies checksums where published
and records a manifest; build-clients-img.sh packs them into a read-only
ISO9660 disc shipped in the rootfs and exported over the gadget as an
optical LUN. build-rnsbox.sh shapes lite (NCM-only, 400M rootfs) vs dvd
(auto-sized) variants and tags rnsbox-rpi0-2w-<variant>.img.

The clients are host-PC installers (win/mac/linux/android) — nothing here
is board-arch-specific.
